# paideia-as-unicode fingerprint golden
# Format: TAG\tINPUT_HEX\tOUTPUT_HEX
# Input is a single-character UTF-8 string; output is the GC short-form
# variant name (Debug format of GeneralCategory).
# Blank lines + lines starting with # are ignored.
gc.ascii.A	41	4c75
gc.ascii.a	61	4c6c
gc.ascii.5	35	4e64
gc.ascii.space	20	5a73
gc.ascii.period	2e	506f
gc.ascii.plus	2b	536d
gc.ascii.lparen	28	5073
gc.ascii.rparen	29	5065
gc.ascii.hyphen	2d	5064
gc.ascii.underscore	5f	5063
